  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        How to: Modify an Existing Transaction Page\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\nUser Interface Extensibility\r\n > Metadata Web Pages\r\n > Transaction Pages\r\n > How to: Modify an Existing Transaction Page\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        Use the Insight Architect tool (How to: Use Insight Architect to Customize a Metadata Page ) or SQL to modify the metadata for a Transaction page as follows.\r\n\r\n\r\n     Step 1: Create a Customized Version of the Screen\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    Make sure that there is a customized version of the desired screen by using Insight Architect. Read Developer Hub.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n     Step 2: Customize Metadata for the Screen\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    Reference the following topics in order to customize the Transaction metadata screen:\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    How to: Override the Details/Transaction Query Engine\r\n\r\n    How to: Create Section Headers on a Detail/Transaction Screen\r\n\r\n    How to: Add Detail/Transaction Screen Menu Options\r\n\r\n    How to: Add a Grid to a Detail/Transaction Screen\r\n\r\n    How to: Add Menu Options to a Details/Transaction Screen Grid\r\n\r\n\r\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nHow to: Modify an Existing Transaction Page\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\n\n\n\r\nUser Interface Extensibility\r\n > Metadata Web Pages\r\n > Transaction Pages\r\n > How to: Modify an Existing Transaction Page\n\n\n\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \nUse the Insight Architect tool (How to: Use Insight Architect to Customize a Metadata Page ) or SQL to modify the metadata for a Transaction page as follows.\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n     Step 1: Create a Customized Version of the Screen\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n    \nMake sure that there is a customized version of the desired screen by using Insight Architect. Read Developer Hub.\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n     Step 2: Customize Metadata for the Screen\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n    \nReference the following topics in order to customize the Transaction metadata screen:\n\r\n\r\n    \n \n\r\n\r\n    \nHow to: Override the Details/Transaction Query Engine\n\r\n\r\n    \nHow to: Create Section Headers on a Detail/Transaction Screen\n\r\n\r\n    \nHow to: Add Detail/Transaction Screen Menu Options\n\r\n\r\n    \nHow to: Add a Grid to a Detail/Transaction Screen\n\r\n\r\n    \nHow to: Add Menu Options to a Details/Transaction Screen Grid\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
